1
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:25,480
Little Monster,

2
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:30,520
you've outdone yourself with that stunt.

3
00:01:31,720 --> 00:01:33,480
The media storm boosted sales

4
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:35,480
of Dark Fairy Tale to 150 million on the first day.

5
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:38,880
I saved you hundreds of millions in marketing costs.

6
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,440
Don't you know?

7
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,080
Those who play with fire

8
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:45,480
will eventually get burned.

9
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:47,680
A hungry wolf in the desert

10
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,440
would lick scorpion venom,

11
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,280
let alone roast meat

12
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:53,640
roasting by the bonfire?

13
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:56,840
What a pity.

14
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,640
If you were my daughter,

15
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:00,800
now

16
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:03,080
you would be ringing the bell on NASDAQ.

17
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:06,240
I'll take it as a compliment.

18
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,560
It's getting late.

19
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:12,200
I'll pack my luggage and leave you to rest.

20
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:14,280
Since you've moved in,

21
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,720
just stay here.

22
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,760
I won't bother you anymore.

23
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,880
You should also get some rest early.

24
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,200
Older people are prone to irregular heartbeats.

25
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:26,920
You need to stay healthy to deal with things later on.

26
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,040
One last question.

27
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:33,040
What exactly do you want?

28
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,560
Shares?

29
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:35,680
A title?

30
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:39,080
Or the lives of my children?

31
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:45,320
As long as future in-law relations are harmonious.

32
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:49,120
After all, you still need to keep your body healthy

33
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:52,120
to teach your grandchildren to sing the family genealogy song.

34
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:03,640
The Rh-negative blood type

35
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:06,760
belongs to autosomal recessive inheritance.

36
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:08,120
That means both parents

37
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:12,240
must carry the recessive gene to have children with panda blood.

38
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:15,120
If both parents have panda blood,

39
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:18,400
a 25% chance of inheriting the blood type,

40
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:21,480
and a 50% chance of maintaining the normal blood type.

41
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:31,880
When did you come back?

42
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:37,160
When I got back to the venue,

43
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,280
they said you had already left.

44
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,520
Our mom is back.

45
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,560
I know.

46
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:51,720
But Uncle Wu said she went to bed early.

47
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:54,120
So I didn't disturb her.

48
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,720
What did you talk about?

49
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,880
She was already asleep when I got back.

50
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:05,720
The kindergarten teacher complained to me

51
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:10,760
that Mumu couldn't draw his dad's face in art class.

52
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,920
I've been too busy with work recently.

53
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,440
I don't have much time to be with him.

54
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:36,320
But fortunately,

55
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,560
you and Liu take care of him.

56
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,800
But children

57
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:46,960
need their father's companionship.

58
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:49,840
The Dark Fairy Tale thing is over.

59
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:53,280
I'll pick up Mumu in a few days.

60
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,760
It's getting late.

61
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:57,920
Get some rest.

62
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:15,920
Qianqian,

63
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:19,600
Jiang Li said some crazy things in the live streaming room today.

64
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:22,840
Actually...

65
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:25,360
Do you remember what blood type Mumu is?

66
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:26,800
O.

67
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:30,680
Mumu's blood type is O.

68
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:33,240
Why do you ask me this?

69
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,680
Qianqian,

70
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:39,960
if you still love me,

71
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:42,160
don't say anything else.

72
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:51,920
Good night.

73
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,160
What's this?

74
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:36,520
This is wild vegetable from my hometown.

75
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:38,400
Young Master loves them the most.

76
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:40,240
Throw it away.

77
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:42,560
These are all homemade.

78
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,680
Very clean.

79
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:57,320
Mom,

80
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,560
I have work at the company later.

81
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,840
I'm leaving now.

82
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,520
Zhou Jian,

83
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,520
after you get to the company,

84
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:13,080
hand over your current work.

85
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:15,480
Take a long vacation for yourself.

86
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:17,680
You're so tired that

87
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:22,400
you can't even remember the title.

88
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,480
Yes, sir.

89
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:33,680
Grandma is back.

90
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:35,120
Grandma.

91
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,640
Mumu,

92
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,760
do you miss me?

93
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,800
Yes.

94
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:43,600
Did you study hard in kindergarten?

95
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,480
Yes.

96
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:46,600
Mumu can recite nursery rhymes very well.

97
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:47,840
Good.

98
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:49,800
Recite one for me.

99
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,160
OK.

100
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:53,080
What do you call your father's father?

101
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:55,360
Grandfather.

102
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:57,680
What do you call your father's mother?

103
00:07:58,280 --> 00:08:00,160
Grandmother.

104
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,840
What do you call your mother's father?

105
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:05,200
Grandfather.

106
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:07,800
What do you call your mom's mom?

107
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:09,560
I call her...

108
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,440
Grandma.

109
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,000
Why did you stop?

110
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,000
Grandma.

111
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,640
You're my mom's mom.

112
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,840
I should call you Grandma.

113
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:20,000
But why do you want me to call you Grandma?

114
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:21,840
Because

115
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:23,720
I'm your grandma.

116
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:26,080
Mom,

117
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:28,320
I'll take Mumu to school.

118
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:31,360
You stay at home and reflect on yourself

119
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,680
for a while.

120
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:36,080
Wu, get the car ready.

121
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:36,720
Yes, ma'am.

122
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:37,240
Yan,

123
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,600
my wild vegetable lunch box.

124
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,000
Mumu,

125
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:43,560
wild vegetables will upset your stomach.

126
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:45,280
When you get off school,

127
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:46,600
I'll take you to eat

128
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:47,800
cream cake,

129
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:48,680
okay?

130
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:49,560
Okay.

131
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:50,480
Let's go.

132
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:01,480
Auntie,

133
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,760
two servings of jianbing.

134
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,160
Would you like to add anything?

135
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,320
What is this?

136
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,480
This is wild vegetable.

137
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:07,800
Give me one.

138
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:08,280
Okay.

139
00:09:08,520 --> 00:09:09,120
It's very delicious.

140
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:09,840
Have a try.

141
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:12,320
Dark Fairy Tale made a miracle on the first day of sales.

142
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,960
But netizens don't think

143
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,600
this is just a marketing plan.

144
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:18,200
Is the internal strife of Golden Thread Fashion Group

145
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,320
real or fake?

146
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:19,960
Thank you.

147
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,480
Will there be a new reversal later?

148
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:23,680
We will continue to follow up.

149
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:25,800
Hope you can like and follow us.

150
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:28,280
Thank you.

151
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,360
I didn't expect you to like spicy gluten.

152
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,240
This spicy gluten is delicious.

153
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,480
Don't you know that in the rich family,

154
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:39,480
spicy gluten is a symbol of poor people?

155
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,760
My grandfather said

156
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:42,280
in the famine years,

157
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:44,000
people could even find sweetness in tree bark.

158
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,880
People live so long,

159
00:09:46,880 --> 00:09:49,520
Pretending decency is more ridiculous than eating spicy gluten.

160
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,920
Elder Shen is really a casual person.

161
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,840
I'll take you to meet him next time.

162
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:55,880
You two must get along well.

163
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:57,680
By the way,

164
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,560
you were right about your suspicion last time.

165
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,360
Zhou Jian

166
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:03,520
did go to the alliance of sisters-in-law.

167
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:05,320
Now that things have gotten so big,

168
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:07,800
netizens won't believe that you're just telling a story.

169
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:09,720
How are you going to wrap this up?

170
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:12,200
Why should I end it?

171
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,240
The netizens love gossip.

172
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,760
The heat will last until the end.

173
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:16,960
But this will also make you

174
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,280
the target of multiple parties.

175
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:21,000
Even if I protect you,

176
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:22,880
it's hard to swallow the golden thread.

177
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,960
I didn't say I wanted to swallow it.

178
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,960
I want to make soup with it

179
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:30,880
and invite everyone to a funeral banquet.

180
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:33,720
I found some information in the Young Master's car.

181
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:35,040
I've sent them to you.

182
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:37,600
Young Master's car accident might just be a coincidence.

183
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,040
How did Lu Xu know?

184
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:40,800
Not sure yet.

185
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:42,880
But I feel

186
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:44,760
someone wants to bring that up.

187
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,760
Investigate Jiang Li thoroughly.

188
00:10:47,280 --> 00:10:48,400
I always feel

189
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:50,480
this girl is not simple.

190
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:52,760
Investigate thoroughly.

191
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,520
Handle properly.

192
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:57,560
Make sure there are no traces of that.

193
00:10:58,680 --> 00:10:59,240
Okay.

194
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,200
Give me some time.

195
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:03,240
Old Wu,

196
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:04,440
thank you

197
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,320
for your hard work over the years.

198
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,800
It's my duty.

199
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,240
You can tell Mumu

200
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:21,760
that his biological father

201
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:25,080
is a scoundrel who is madly in love with his mother.

202
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:40,280
Hello.

203
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,000
What's up?

204
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:41,800
Miss Lu.

205
00:11:42,920 --> 00:11:44,240
I want to see you.

206
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:45,520
Now.

207
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,040
Okay.

208
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:48,880
I'll send you the address.

209
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:11,200
Mu Chen often says that

210
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:13,520
a younger sister is like a wild vine.

211
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:15,880
But now it seems that

212
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:19,920
you are better at strangling prey than a wild vine.

213
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:29,000
Are you complimenting me for being better than my teacher,

214
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:31,440
or are you here to repent

215
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,760
and see how tall the grass on her grave has grown?

216
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:38,080
You have her stubbornness in your eyes.

217
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,720
Yes, we do.

218
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:45,760
But there's a colder fire in your pupils.

219
00:12:46,880 --> 00:12:49,320
So, do you love me for these eyes that resemble hers,

220
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:52,400
or for this fire that can burn you and the Lu family?

221
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:04,400
I've liked her since high school.

222
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:08,880
But because of my background at that time,

223
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:11,600
I never had the courage.

224
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,280
But later, fortunately,

225
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:18,320
I found

226
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:21,960
that she had feelings for me.

227
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:27,080
When I was in college,

228
00:13:28,040 --> 00:13:29,400
we met again

229
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:31,920
and became a couple.

230
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:34,520
I used to dream that

231
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:39,080
if I were rich,

232
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:41,800
I would buy her a big diamond ring

233
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:45,400
and propose to her like a knight

234
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,520
welcoming a princess

235
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:50,840
like a knight welcomes a princess.

236
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,280
But the reality is that

237
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:58,320
we can squeeze into a

238
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:02,280
one-bedroom apartment

239
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,720
and eat instant noodles together.

240
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:08,200
That's also a very happy thing.

241
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,840
Now I have the ability to do it.

242
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:15,440
I have the ability.

243
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:28,040
But

244
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:30,320
she lies in this

245
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:32,120
tomb costing thousands of yuan per square meter.

246
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,640
My sister believed in you until her death.

247
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,120
Why did you choose Lu Qianqian?

248
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:45,280
My encounter with Qianqian was an accident.

249
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:51,760
But this accident indirectly killed her.

250
00:15:09,600 --> 00:15:10,920
How dare you sit in

251
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:12,400
the chairman's chair?

252
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,720
It's just a chair.

253
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:22,640
I'll sit for a while.

254
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,880
Shh.

255
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:31,600
Ouch.

256
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:38,280
What are you doing?

257
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:39,000
Shh.

258
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:39,960
Don't talk.

259
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,080
Get down.

260
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:04,320
No.

261
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:22,360
Stand here.

262
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:22,960
Stand here and don't move.

263
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:26,360
What were you doing just now?

264
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:27,840
Saving you.

265
00:16:29,800 --> 00:16:31,080
Our chairman

266
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:33,360
hates it when others sit in her chair.

267
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:35,240
The last person who sat in her chair

268
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:38,000
is still mining in Cambodia.

269
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:41,800
You must be the new intern Xixi mentioned.

270
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:46,160
Why are you laughing?

271
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:50,800
I just find you interesting.

272
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:56,520
Oh.

273
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:58,640
Don't wear Chanel clothes

274
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:00,200
at the company anymore.

275
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,160
Why?

276
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:03,320
The company doesn't have a dress code.

277
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:09,560
I heard the young lady is coming back

278
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:10,920
and will be working at the company.

279
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:11,840
So what?

280
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:13,280
What I wear doesn't affect her.

281
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:16,760
You really don't know anything, do you?

282
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:18,480
You...

283
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:19,440
The...

284
00:17:21,320 --> 00:17:23,720
The young lady loves Chanel clothes the most.

285
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:25,240
What you're doing is basically suicide.

286
00:17:25,240 --> 00:17:26,360
Suicide, you know?

287
00:17:26,560 --> 00:17:27,720
That crazy woman

288
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:31,240
She splashed wine on her dress twin.

289
00:17:31,280 --> 00:17:33,800
Later, I heard she even stuffed that person in the trunk.

290
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:36,400
Just because they wore the same dress.

291
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:41,600
Where did you hear these rumors?

292
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:43,160
My colleagues at the company.

293
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:46,960
They all say so.

294
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:51,720
Suddenly I realize

295
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:55,120
you're quite concerned about me, an intern.

296
00:17:56,720 --> 00:17:58,400
We're all new to the workplace.

297
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:01,480
I think as long as we can be colleagues,

298
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:02,480
it's fate.

299
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:03,760
I'll help you if I can.

300
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:06,600
A friend in need is a friend indeed.

301
00:18:07,080 --> 00:18:07,880
Hello.

302
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:08,880
I'm Zhou Jian.

303
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:11,320
I'm

304
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:13,680
Chen Qianqian.

305
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:14,720
Oh.

306
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:15,760
You just came to the company.

307
00:18:15,760 --> 00:18:17,480
I have to remind you of something.
